      "W": {
        "slot": "W",
        "id": "SettW",
        "name": "Haymaker",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Sett passively stores damage he takes as Grit. On cast, Sett expends all stored Grit to gain a shield and punch an area, dealing true damage in the center and physical damage on the sides.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Sett stores 100% of damage taken as <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Grit</span>, up to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">(50% Health)</span>. <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Grit</span> decays quickly 4 seconds after the damage was taken.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Sett consumes all <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Grit</span>, gaining a <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">100% Grit consumed Shield</span> decaying over 3 seconds. Sett then delivers a massive punch, dealing <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">80/100/120/140/160 plus (25% + (0.25% bonus Attack Damage)) Grit consumed true damage</span> to enemies in the center (max <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">? damage</span>). Enemies not in the center instead take <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">physical damage</span>.",
