        "bodyHtml": "Sett grabs an enemy champion and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Suppresses</span> them as he carries them forward, then slams them into the ground, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(200/300/400 + (120% bonus Attack Damage)) plus 40/50/60% of the grabbed enemy's bonus Health physical damage</span> to surrounding enemies and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowing</span> them by 99% for 1 second. Enemies take less damage the further they are from where Sett lands.",
